<title>USA: Triangle sees maintaining profit levels.</title>
<headline>Triangle sees maintaining profit levels.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triangle Pacific Corp said Friday it believes it will be able to maintain current profitability levels and expects to have a good full year.</p>
<p>Earlier, the compmany reported consolidated net income for the quarter ended April 4 of $5.9 million, or $0.38 per share, on consolidated net sales of $145.2 million, versus net income of $3.9 million, or $0.26 per share, on net sales of $110.5 million in the same quarter last year.</p>
